// this flag. If it is set, gst_nonstream_audio_decoder_handle_loop() is called,
// and the flag is cleared. (This function call is necessary in LOOPING mode
// because it updates the current segment and makes sure the next buffer that
// is sent downstream has its DISCONT flag set.) - When the current subsong is
// switched, set_current_subsong is called. If it fails, a warning is reported,
// and nothing else is done. Otherwise, it calls get_subsong_duration to get
// the new current subsongs's duration, get_subsong_tags to get its tags,
