// generates a duration message), updates the current segment, and sends the
// subsong's tags in an event downstream. (If set_current_subsong has been set
// to NULL by the subclass, attempts to set a current subsong are ignored;
// likewise, if get_subsong_duration is NULL, no duration is reported, and if
